# Secrets, logs, temporary files and development-only formats.
**/.env*
**/.dev.vars*
**/*credentials*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*.map
**/*.py
